      "name": "Command Confusion",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature fails its save against Mnoghoth's mindfog aura\n\n---\n\nEffect Mnoghoth determines who the Confused creature attacks for that round, instead of the target being randomly determined by the GM. If the chosen target is the confused creature's ally, the creature can immediately attempt a DC 25 Will save save; on a success, its target is determined randomly as normal for confusion, and on a critical success the target is no longer confused."
