      ],
      "text": "20 feet. A creature that starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 25 Will save save or become Confused for 1 round; on a success, that creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute. Mnoghoth can suppress or activate this aura as a single action with the concentrate trait.",
